    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to go with Google Cloud Logging for the `write_structured_log.py` file. It's a managed service, making integration easier. I'm focusing now on how to best identify the logging service within the Python code for a clean implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing the Logging Code**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in writing the Python code for `write_structured_log.py`. The plan is to leverage the `google.cloud.logging` client for this implementation and integrate it directly into the script. The structured JSON log entry will be the focus, ensuring it aligns with the provider's expectations. Once complete, I'll commit the Python file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818384844,
          "start": 1789818383184
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97d2b50001k3cvvujFO1ooaE",
      "message_id": "msg_0b97d2630001eOqVPx8lEuMQPs",
      "session_id": "ses_f4682da54ffeJgeuZhfe4nmNB5",
      "time_created": 1789818383184,
      "time_updated": 1789818384845
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "uObMAANfw9HgZBYV",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import logging\n\ndef write_structured_log(log_name, message, severity=\"INFO\"):\n    \"\"\"Writes a structured JSON log event to Google Cloud Logging.\n\n    Args:\n        log_name (str): The name of the log to write to (e.g., \"my-application-log\").\n        message (dict): A dictionary representing the structured log message.\n        severity (str): The severity level of the log (e.g., \"INFO\", \"ERROR\", \"DEBUG\").\n    \"\"\"\n    client = logging.Client()\n    logger = client.logger(log_name)\n\n    logger.log_struct(\n        message,\n        severity=severity\n    )\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Example usage:\n    log_name = \"my-application-log\"\n    structured_message = {\n        \"event_type\": \"user_login\",\n        \"user_id\": \"user123\",\n        \"ip_address\": \"192.168.1.1\",\n        \"status\": \"success\"\n    }\n    write_structured_log(log_name, structured_message, severity=\"INFO\")\n    print(f\"Structured log written to Google Cloud Logging under log '{log_name}'\")\n",
            "filePath": "write_structured_log.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "diagnostics": {},
            "exists": false,
            "filepath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-sl9b2fra/write_structured_log.py",
